        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 8571, Solid Brass Charleston Pocket Door Flush Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Baldwin the Charleston Sliding Pocket Door Pull is built to last out of forged brass. The Baldwin 8571 Pocket Door Pull can be used as a pocket door flush pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith every detail, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style\u0014 throughout the life of your door. For an investment in your home that will last for many years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin 8571 Charleston Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<li>Total Height: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth:  1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height:  5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width:  1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Package includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually</b> - Order 2 if you need one for each side of a pocket door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n <p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b><font color=red>This item is discontinued by Baldwin.</font></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\nSee available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\"><b>Recessed Handles<b></a>\r\n</p>",
